.TH MARBOR\-WARMUP 1 "2026-08-17" "marbor dev" "Marbor Manual"
.SH NAME
marbor\-warmup \- global warmup engine status and manual controls
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B marbor warmup
[action] [args] [\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
global warmup engine status and manual controls
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
show global warmup engine status
.TP
.B predictive
enable/disable the predictive prewarm engine
.TP
.B predictive set
enable/disable the predictive prewarm engine
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-enabled
enable the predictive engine
.RE
.TP
.B ping
manually trigger a warmup cycle now
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-server
Admin API base URL (default "http://localhost:8080", env MARBOR_SERVER)
.TP
.B \-\-json
output machine\-readable JSON instead of a human table
.TP
.B \-\-username
admin username, used to log in (env MARBOR_USERNAME)
.TP
.B \-\-password
admin password, used to log in (env MARBOR_PASSWORD)
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmarbor\fR(1)
